/-! # WP-C5, file 3: the profiles of MATH2 §1

* `rho`: smooth, `0` on `(−∞, 2]`, `1` on `[3, ∞)`; `rt τ = ρ(e^τ)` and its derivatives `rt1`, `rt2`.
* `gS s τ = ρ(e^τ) e^{sτ}`: the profile of the cut-off part `h_s` (`gS_log : gS s (log h) = ρ(h) h^s`).
